# EAS Build upload rules (2026-10-09). Expo would otherwise archive the whole repo (4.3 GB:
# data/, textbooks/, web/, api/…). The phone build needs only mobile/ and packages/shared/
# (mobile/package.json links it by `file:../packages/shared`). Builds run with EAS_NO_VCS=1
# and EAS_PROJECT_ROOT=<repo root>, so this file — not .gitignore — decides what is uploaded.
# Top-level folders and files the phone build does not need (listed explicitly — a
# "/*" + "!/mobile/" pair was tried first and dropped mobile/ itself from the archive).
/.claude/
/.devlogs/
/.git/
/.pytest_cache/
/.walk_tmp/
/Claude outputs/
/api/
/archive/
/aruvi-scripts/
/aruvi_core/
/backup/
/backups/
/cowork prompts/
/data/
/deploy/
/docs/
/genon/
node_modules/
/out/
/runtime_data/
/site/
/tests/
/textbooks/
/web/
/.dockerignore
/.gitignore
/CLAUDE.md
/MEMORY.md
/STORAGE_POLICY.md
/Dockerfile
/dev.sh
/package.json
/package-lock.json
/pyproject.toml
/render.yaml
*.log

# Inside mobile/ and packages/
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/
mobile/.expo/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
